msgstr "ຂະໜາດປັດຈຸບັນ: %{size}"

#. TRANSLATORS: label when the device is used by a multi-device Btrfs, where %{btrfs} is replaced
#. by the display name of the filesystem (e.g., "Btrfs over 5 devices").
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/blk_device_resize.rb:196
#, perl-brace-format
msgid "Part of %{btrfs}"
msgstr "ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ %{btrfs}"

#. TRANSLATORS: label for currently used size of the partition or LVM volume,
#. where %{size} is replaced by a size (e.g., 5.5 GiB)
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/blk_device_resize.rb:208
#, perl-brace-format
msgid "Currently used: %{size}"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ປັດຈຸບັນ: %{size}"

#. TRANSLATORS: Note added to the dialog for trying to unmount a device
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/blk_device_resize.rb:239
msgid "It is not possible to shrink the file system while it is mounted."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຍໍ້ຂະໜາດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນຖືກເມົາທ໌ຢູ່."

#. TRANSLATORS: Note added to the dialog for trying to unmount a device
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/blk_device_resize.rb:252
msgid "It is not possible to extend the file system while it is mounted."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍລະບົບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ມັນຖືກເມົາທ໌ຢູ່."

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is replaced by a number that represents the amount of GiB to extend (e.g., 56).
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/blk_device_resize.rb:266
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You are extending a mounted filesystem by %s Gigabyte. \n"
"This may be quite slow and can take hours. You might possibly want \n"
"to consider umounting the filesystem, which will increase speed of \n"
"resize task a lot."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານກຳລັງຂະຫຍາຍລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເມົາທ໌ຢູ່ %s Gigabyte. \n"
"ຂະບວນການນີ້ອາດຈະຊ້າຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ເວລາຫຼາຍຊົ່ວໂມງ. ທ່ານອາດຈະ\n"
"ພິຈາລະນາຍົກເລີກການເມົາທ໌ (umount) ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ກ່ອນ, ເຊິ່ງຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້\n"
"ການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໄວຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ."

