#. TRANSLATORS: Error message, where %{stripes} is replaced by a number (e.g., 1) and
#. %{max_size} is replaced by a device size (e.g., 4 GiB).
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/lvm_lv_size.rb:161
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The maximum size of a striped volume is limited by the number of stripes and "
"the size of the physical volumes. According to the current configuration of "
"the volume group, the maximum size for a striped volume with %{stripes} "
"stripes cannot be bigger than %{max_size}. Please, adjust the selected "
"size.\n"
"\n"
"Also consider the size of other striped volumes. Otherwise the volume group "
"might not be able to allocate all the striped volumes."
msgstr ""
"ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງ striped volume ແມ່ນຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍຈຳນວນ stripe ແລະ ຂະໜາດຂອງ physical "
"volume. ອີງຕາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າປັດຈຸບັນຂອງກຸ່ມວໍລຸມ, ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດສຳລັບ striped volume ທີ່ມີ %"
"{stripes} stripes ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ %{max_size}. ກະລຸນາປັບຂະໜາດທີ່ເລືອກ.\n"
"\n"
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ ຄວນພິຈາລະນາຂະໜາດຂອງ striped volume ອື່ນໆນຳ. ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ ກຸ່ມວໍລຸມອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຈັດສັນພື້ນ"
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ striped volume ທັງໝົດໄດ້."

