#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:149
msgid "RAID Type:"
msgstr "ປະເພດ RAID:"

#. Items for the RadioButtonGroup
#. TRANSLATORS: table header, type of md raid.
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:170
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/columns/raid_type.rb:37
msgid "RAID Type"
msgstr "ປະເພດ RAID"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:174
msgid ""
"<b>RAID 0:</b> This level increases your disk performance. There is <b>NO</"
"b> redundancy in this mode. If one of the drives crashes, data recovery will "
"not be possible."
msgstr ""
"<b>RAID 0:</b> ລະດັບນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບຂອງດິສກ໌. ແຕ່ <b>ບໍ່ມີ</b> ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນ "
"(redundancy) ໃນໂໝດນີ້. ຫາກໄດຣຟ໌ໃດໜຶ່ງເພ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:181
msgid ""
"<b>RAID 1:</b> This mode has the best redundancy. It can be used with two or "
"more disks. This mode maintains an exact copy of all data on all disks. As "
"long as at least one disk is still working, no data are lost. The partitions "
"used for this type of RAID should have approximately the same size."
msgstr ""
"<b>RAID 1:</b> ໂໝດນີ້ມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບດິສກ໌ສອງໜ່ວຍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ໂໝດນີ້ຈະເກັບກ໊"
"ອບປີ້ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຄືກັນທຸກປະການໄວ້ໃນທຸກດິສກ໌. ຕາບໃດທີ່ຍັງມີດິສກ໌ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງໜ່ວຍເຮັດວຽກຢູ່, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະບໍ່ສູນຫາຍ. ສ່ວນແ"
"ບ່ງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ RAID ປະເພດນີ້ຄວນມີຂະໜາດໃກ້ຄຽງກັນ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:191
msgid ""
"<b>RAID 5:</b>This mode combines management of a larger number of disks and "
"still maintains some redundancy. This mode can be used on three disks or "
"more. If one disk fails, all data are still intact. If two disks fail "
"simultaneously, all data are lost."
msgstr ""
"<b>RAID 5:</b> ໂໝດນີ້ລວມການຈັດການດິສກ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ ແລະ ຍັງຄົງຮັກສາການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ບາງສ່ວນ. ໂໝ"
"ດນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບດິສກ໌ສາມໜ່ວຍ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ຫາກດິສກ໌ໜຶ່ງໜ່ວຍເພ, ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຍັງຄົງຢູ່. ແຕ່ຫາກດິສກ໌ເພພ້ອມກັນສອ"
"ງໜ່ວຍ, ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດຈະສູນຫາຍ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:200
msgid ""
"<b>RAID 6:</b>This is similar to RAID 5, but with even more redundancy. This "
"requires at least four disks. If two out of four disks fail simultaneously, "
"no data are lost."
msgstr ""
"<b>RAID 6:</b> ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ RAID 5 ແຕ່ມີການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ຕ້ອງການດິສກ໌ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍສີ່ໜ່ວຍ. ຫາກດິສ"
"ກ໌ເພພ້ອມກັນສອງໜ່ວຍຈາກສີ່ໜ່ວຍ, ຂໍ້ມູນຈະບໍ່ສູນຫາຍ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:207
msgid ""
"<b>RAID 10:</b>This combines RAID 0 (striping) and RAID 1 (mirroring) for "
"improved performance while still maintaining redundancy and thus crash "
"recovery."
msgstr ""
"<b>RAID 10:</b> ລວມເອົາ RAID 0 (striping) ແລະ RAID 1 (mirroring) ເຂົ້າກັນ ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປ"
"ະສິດທິພາບໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍັງຄົງຮັກສາການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ ເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນຂໍ້ມູນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ລະບົບເພ."

#. @macro seeAbstractWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:228
msgid "Raid &Name (optional)"
msgstr "&ຊື່ Raid (ທາງເລືອກ)"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md.rb:232
msgid ""
"<p><b>Raid Name: </b> A meaningful name for the RAID. This is optional. If a "
"name is provided, the device is available as <tt>/dev/md/&lt;name&gt;</tt>.</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຊື່ Raid:</b> ຊື່ທີ່ມີຄວາມໝາຍສຳລັບ RAID. ສ່ວນນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ. ຫາກມີການລະບຸຊື່, ອຸປະກອນຈະສ"
"າມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານ <tt>/dev/md/&lt;name&gt;</tt>.</p>"

#. @param controller [Actions::Controllers::Md]
#. TRANSLATORS: table header, chunk size of md raid
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md_options.rb:89
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/columns/chunk_size.rb:37
msgid "Chunk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Chunk"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md_options.rb:93
msgid ""
"<p><b>Chunk Size:</b> It is the smallest \"atomic\" mass of data that can be "
"written to the devices. A reasonable chunk size for RAID 5 is 128 kB. For "
"RAID 0, 32 kB is a good starting point.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ຂະໜາດ Chunk:</b> ແມ່ນກຸ່ມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ນ້ອຍທີ່ສຸດທີ່ຈະຖືກຂຽນລົງໃນອຸປະກອນ. ຂະໜາດ chunk ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ"
"ສຳລັບ RAID 5 ແມ່ນ 128 kB. ສຳລັບ RAID 0, 32 kB ແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີ.</p>"

#. @param controller [Actions::Controllers::Md]
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md_options.rb:131
msgid "Parity Algorithm"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ Parity"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/dialogs/md_options.rb:135
msgid ""
"<p><b>Parity Algorithm:</b> The parity algorithm to use with RAID 5/6. Left-"
"symmetric is the one that offers maximum performance on typical disks with "
"rotating platters.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ Parity:</b> ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ parity ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ກັບ RAID 5/6. Left-symmetric ແມ່ນອັນ"
"ທີ່ໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດໃນດິສກ໌ທົ່ວໄປແບບຈານໝຸນ.</p>"

