msgstr "&ປ້າຍຊື່ LUKS (ເລືອກໄດ້)"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error pop-up
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/encrypt_label.rb:55
msgid "This LUKS label is already in use. Select a different one."
msgstr "ປ້າຍຊື່ LUKS ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາເລືອກຊື່ໃໝ່."

#. @macro seeAbstractWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/encrypt_method.rb:50
msgid "Encryption method"
msgstr "ວິທີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#. @macro seeCustomWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/encrypt_method_options.rb:118
msgid ""
"Be careful: the system cannot hibernate when\n"
"encrypting swap with randomly generated keys.\n"
"\n"
"Moreover, using this with some kinds of devices\n"
"may imply a certain risk of losing data.\n"
"\n"
"Read the help for more information."
msgstr ""
"ລະວັງ: ລະບົບບໍ່ສາມາດຈຳສີນ (hibernate) ໄດ້ເມື່ອ\n"
"ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ swap ດ້ວຍຄີທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນແບບສຸ່ມ.\n"
"\n"
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ກັບບາງອຸປະກອນ\n"
"ອາດມີຄວາມສ່ຽງໃນການສູນເສຍຂໍ້ມູນ.\n"
"\n"
"ອ່ານສ່ວນຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

#. Checks whether the secure key can be generated
