msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຄືນໃໝ່ເພື່ອ&ຢືນຢັນ:"

#. @macro seeAbstractWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:98
msgid ""
"<p>First, choose whether the partition should be\n"
"formatted and the desired file system type.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທຳອິດ, ເລືອກວ່າຄວນຟໍແມັດພາທິຊັນຫຼືບໍ່\n"
"ແລະ ເລືອກປະເພດລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຕ້ອງການ.</p>"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:102
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to encrypt all data on the\n"
"volume, select <b>Encrypt Device</b>. Changing the encryption on an "
"existing\n"
"volume will delete all data on it.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນ\n"
"ວໍລຸມ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກ <b>ເຂົ້າລະຫັດອຸປະກອນ</b>. ການປ່ຽນແປງການເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ\n"
"ວໍລຸມທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວຈະລຶບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນນັ້ນ.</p>\n"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:108
msgid ""
"<p>Then, choose whether the partition should\n"
"be mounted and enter the mount point (/, /boot, /home, /var, etc.).</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຈາກນັ້ນ, ເລືອກວ່າຄວນເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount) ພາທິຊັນຫຼືບໍ່\n"
"ແລະ ປ້ອນຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (/, /boot, /home, /var, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ).</p>"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:121
msgid "Format device"
msgstr "ຟໍແມັດອຸປະກອນ"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:129
msgid "Do not format device"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຟໍແມັດອຸປະກອນ"

#. Synchronize the widget with the information from the controller
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:218
msgid "Mount device"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນ"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:226
msgid "Do not mount device"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນ"

#. It does not have subvolumes, so let's simply restore the default list.
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:285
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"You have chosen to mount the device at %{mount_path}.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to remove the current subvolumes and\n"
"create the suggested subvolumes for %{mount_path}?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ເລືອກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນທີ່ %{mount_path}.\n"
"\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການເອົາວໍລຸມຍ່ອຍປະຈຸບັນອອກ ແລະ\n"
"ສ້າງວໍລຸມຍ່ອຍທີ່ແນະນຳສຳລັບ %{mount_path} ຫຼື ບໍ່?"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:291
msgid ""
"You have changed the mount point of the device.\n"
"\n"
"Do you want to delete the current subvolumes?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ປ່ຽນຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງອຸປະກອນ.\n"
"\n"
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຶບວໍລຸມຍ່ອຍປະຈຸບັນຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message when a device should be mounted by label but no label is given.
#. TRANSLATORS: Error messagge when the label is not given.
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:326
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/fstab_options.rb:316
msgid "Provide a volume label to mount by label."
msgstr "ລະບຸປ້າຍຊື່ວໍລຸມເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຕາມປ້າຍຊື່."

#. Translators: popup text
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:348
msgid ""
"\n"
"You chose to install onto an existing partition that will not be\n"
"formatted. YaST cannot guarantee your installation will succeed,\n"
"particularly in any of the following cases:\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ທ່ານເລືອກຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນພາທິຊັນທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ຖືກ\n"
"ຟໍແມັດ. YaST ບໍ່ສາມາດຮັບປະກັນວ່າການຕິດຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານຈະສຳເລັດ,\n"
"ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນກໍລະນີຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. continued popup text
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:355
msgid ""
"- if this is an existing Btrfs partition\n"
"- if this partition already contains a Linux distribution that will be\n"
"overwritten\n"
"- if this partition does not yet contain a file system\n"
msgstr ""
"- ຫາກນີ້ເປັນພາທິຊັນ Btrfs ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ\n"
"- ຫາກພາທິຊັນນີ້ມີ Linux distribution ຢູ່ແລ້ວເຊິ່ງຈະຖືກ\n"
"ຂຽນທັບ\n"
"- ຫາກພາທິຊັນນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌\n"

#. continued popup text
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:362
msgid ""
"If in doubt, better go back and mark this partition for\n"
"formatting, especially if it is assigned to one of the standard mount "
"points\n"
"like /, /boot, /opt or /var.\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກບໍ່ໝັ້ນໃຈ, ຄວນກັບຄືນໄປ ແລະ ໝາຍພາທິຊັນນີ້ສຳລັບການ\n"
"ຟໍແມັດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະຫາກມັນຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນໜຶ່ງໃນຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ມາດຕະຖານ\n"
"ເຊັ່ນ /, /boot, /opt ຫຼື /var.\n"

#. continued popup text
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/format_and_mount.rb:368
msgid ""
"If you decide to format the partition, all data on it will be lost.\n"
"\n"
"Really skip formatting the partition?\n"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕັດສິນໃຈຟໍແມັດພາທິຊັນ, ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດໃນນັ້ນຈະສູນຫາຍ.\n"
"\n"
"ຕ້ອງການຂ້າມການຟໍແມັດພາທິຊັນແທ້ຫຼືບໍ່?\n"

#. Synchronize the widget with the information from the controller
