#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:43
msgid ""
"<p><b>Available Devices:</b> A list of available LVM physical volumes. If "
"this list is empty, you need to create partitions as \"Raw Volume "
"(unformatted)\" with partition ID \"Linux LVM\"in the \"Hard Disks\" view of "
"the partitioner.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່:</b> ລາຍຊື່ອຸປະກອນ physical volumes ຂອງ LVM ທີ່ມີຢູ່. ຫາກລາຍຊື່ນີ້ວ່າງເປົ່"
"າ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງສ້າງພາທິຊັນເປັນແບບ \"Raw Volume (unformatted)\" ທີ່ມີ ID ພາທິຊັນເປັນ \"Linux "
"LVM\" ໃນມຸມມອງ \"ຮາດດິດ\" ຂອງ Partitioner.</p>"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:52
msgid ""
"<p><b>Selected Devices:</b> The physical volumes to create this volume group "
"from. If needed, you can always add more physical volumes later.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກ:</b> physical volumes ທີ່ຈະນຳມາສ້າງກຸ່ມວໍລຸມນີ້. ຫາກຈຳເປັນ, ທ່ານສາມາດເ"
"ພີ່ມ physical volumes ອື່ນໆໄດ້ໃນພາຍຫຼັງ.</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message where %s is replaced by a size (e.g., 4 GiB).
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:136
#, c-format
msgid "The volume group size cannot be less than %s."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດກຸ່ມວໍລຸມບໍ່ສາມາດນ້ອຍກວ່າ %s ໄດ້."

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message, where %s is replaced by a number (e.g., 3).
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:147
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The number of physcal volumes is not enough. The volume group contains "
"striped logical volumes. Please, select at least %s devices in order to "
"satisfy the number of stripes of the current volumes."
msgstr ""
"ຈຳນວນ physical volumes ບໍ່ພຽງພໍ. ກຸ່ມວໍລຸມປະກອບດ້ວຍ striped logical volumes. ກະລຸນາເລືອ"
"ກຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ %s ອຸປະກອນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພຽງພໍກັບຈຳນວນ stripes ຂອງວໍລຸມປະຈຸບັນ."

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:161
msgid ""
"The volume group contains striped logical volumes and the selected devices "
"are too small to allocate them. Note that the size of a striped volume is "
"limited by its number of stripes and the size of the physical volumes."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມວໍລຸມປະກອບດ້ວຍ striped logical volumes ແລະ ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ ທີ່ຈະຈັດສັນໃຫ້"
"ພວກມັນ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າ ຂະໜາດຂອງ striped volume ຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍ ຈຳນວນ stripes ຂອງມັນ ແລະ ຂ"
"ະໜາດຂອງ physical volumes."

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message when several physical volumes cannot be removed, where
#. %{pvs} is replaced by device names (e.g., /dev/sda1, /dev/sda2) and %{vg} is
#. replaced by the volume group name (e.g., system)
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:180
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Removing physical volumes %{pvs} from the volume group %{vg}\n"
"is not supported because the physical volumes may be already in use"
msgstr ""
"ການເອົາ physical volumes %{pvs} ອອກຈາກກຸ່ມວໍລຸມ %{vg}\n"
"ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ເພາະ physical volumes ອາດຖືກໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

#. TRANSLATORS: Error message when a physical volume cannot be removed, where
#. %{pvs} is replaced by device name (e.g., /dev/sda1) and %{vg} is replaced
#. by the volume group name (e.g., system)
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/lvm_vg_devices_selector.rb:186
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"Removing the physical volume %{pvs} from the volume group %{vg}\n"
"is not supported because the physical volume may be already in use"
msgstr ""
"ການເອົາ physical volume %{pvs} ອອກຈາກກຸ່ມວໍລຸມ %{vg}\n"
"ບໍ່ຖືກຮອງຮັບ ເພາະ physical volume ອາດຖືກໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແລ້ວ"

#. TRANSLATORS: html text containing the help for the Partitioner menubar, make
#. sure the titles match the menu names
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/main_menu_bar.rb:87
msgid ""
"<p>All the possible Partitioner actions are represented in the\n"
"menu bar at the top:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>System</b>\n"
"contains global actions that affect the storage setup as a whole.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>Add</b>\n"
"allows to create new virtual devices and also to divide the device\n"
"selected below into logical units like partitions or subvolumes.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>Device</b>\n"
"gathers all the actions that can be performed on the entry currently\n"
"selected in the table below.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>View</b>\n"
"grants access to special sections of the Partitioner not strictly related\n"
"to the current selected device.\n"
"</li>\n"
"</ul>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ທຸກການກະທຳທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້ຂອງ Partitioner ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນ\n"
"ແຖບເມນູດ້ານເທິງ:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li><b>ລະບົບ</b>\n"
"ປະກອບດ້ວຍການກະທຳທົ່ວໄປທີ່ສົ່ງຜົນຕໍ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>ເພີ່ມ</b>\n"
"ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສ້າງອຸປະກອນສະເໝືອນໃໝ່ ແລະ ຍັງສາມາດແບ່ງອຸປະກອນ\n"
"ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເປັນໜ່ວຍຍ່ອຍ ເຊັ່ນ ພາທິຊັນ ຫຼື ວໍລຸມຍ່ອຍ.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>ອຸປະກອນ</b>\n"
"ລວມທຸກການກະທຳທີ່ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ກັບລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກ\n"
"ໃນຕາຕະລາງດ້ານລຸ່ມ.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li><b>ມຸມມອງ</b>\n"
"ໃຫ້ການເຂົ້າເຖິງສ່ວນພິເສດຂອງ Partitioner ທີ່ບໍ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງ\n"
"ກັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກໃນປະຈຸບັນ.\n"
"</li>\n"
"</ul>"

#. TRANSLATORS: button label to add a MD Raid
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/md_buttons.rb:36
msgid "Add RAID..."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ RAID..."

#. @return [Y2Partitioner::Actions::Controllers::Md]
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/md_devices_selector.rb:134
msgid ""
"<p><b>Available Devices:</b> Unused disks and partitions that can be used "
"for a RAID. A disk can be used if it does not contain any partitions and no "
"filesystem directly on the disk. A partition can be used if it is not "
"mounted. It is recommended to use partition ID \"Linux RAID\" for those "
"partitions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່:</b> ດິດ ແລະ ພາທິຊັນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດນຳມາໃຊ້ ສຳລັບ RAID. ສາມາດໃຊ້ດິດ"
"ໄດ້ຫາກມັນບໍ່ມີພາທິຊັນໃດໆ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍກົງເທິງດິດ. ພາທິຊັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ຫາກມັນບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ແນ"
"ະນຳໃຫ້ ໃຊ້ ID ພາທິຊັນເປັນ \"Linux RAID\" ສຳລັບພາທິຊັນເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ.</p>"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/md_devices_selector.rb:145
msgid ""
"<p><b>Selected Devices:</b> The disks and partitions that are used for the "
"RAID. Different RAID levels have different requirements for the minimum "
"number of devices. </p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>ອຸປະກອນທີ່ເລືອກ:</b> ດິດ ແລະ ພາທິຊັນທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບ RAID. ລະດັບ RAID ແຕ່ລະປະເພດມີຂໍ້ກຳນົດສ"
"ຳລັບຈຳນວນອຸປະກອນ ຂັ້ນຕ່ຳທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ. </p>"

