msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Inode ເປັນໄບຕ໌"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:71
msgid ""
"Specify the inode size in bytes.If 'auto' is selected the inode size is "
"determined by the file system size and will typically be 256."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຂະໜາດ Inode ເປັນໄບຕ໌. ຫາກເລືອກ 'auto' ຂະໜາດ Inode ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍຂະໜາດຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ "
"ແລະ ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຈະແມ່ນ 256."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:81
msgid "Bytes to &Inode Ratio"
msgstr "ອັດຕາສ່ວນ ໄບຕ໌ ຕໍ່ Inode"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:86
msgid ""
"Specify the bytes to inode ratio. YaST creates an inode for every bytes-per-"
"inode bytes of space on the disk. The larger the bytes-per-inode ratio, the "
"fewer inodes will be created. Generally, this value should not be smaller "
"than the block size of the file system, since in that case more inodes would "
"be made than can ever be used. Note that this is not the size of the inode "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸອັດຕາສ່ວນ ໄບຕ໌ ຕໍ່ Inode. YaST ຈະສ້າງ Inode ໜຶ່ງອັນຕໍ່ທຸກໆ ໄບຕ໌-ຕໍ່-Inode ຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃນດິດ. ຍິ່ງອັ"
"ດຕາສ່ວນ ໄບຕ໌-ຕໍ່-Inode ໃຫຍ່ເທົ່າໃດ, ຈຳນວນ Inode ທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນກໍຍິ່ງໜ້ອຍລົງເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້"
"ວ, ຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ຄວນນ້ອຍກວ່າຂະໜາດບລັອກຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌, ເພາະໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນ Inode ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍເກີນກວ່າທີ່ຈະ"
"ສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ: ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວ Inode ເອງ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:99
msgid "Percentage of Blocks &Reserved for root"
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນຂອງບລັອກທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ໃຫ້ root"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:105
msgid "Allowed are float numbers between 0 and 50."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລກທົດສະນິຍົມລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 50."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:109
msgid ""
"Specify the percentage of blocks reserved for the super user. Typically 5% "
"are reserved."
msgstr "ລະບຸເປີເຊັນຂອງບລັອກທີ່ຈອງໄວ້ໃຫ້ super user. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະຈອງໄວ້ 5%."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:118
msgid "Stride &Length in Blocks"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວ Stride ໃນບລັອກ"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:124
msgid "Enter a number that is at least 1 or 'none'."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຕົວເລກຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 ຫຼື 'none'."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:128
msgid ""
"Set the the number of blocks in a RAID stripe. This is the number of blocks "
"read or written to disk before moving to the next disk (also referred to as "
"the chunk size). Valid values are numbers greater than 0, or 'none'."
msgstr ""
"ກຳນົດຈຳນວນບລັອກໃນແຖບ RAID. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນບລັອກທີ່ອ່ານ ຫຼື ຂຽນລົງດິດກ່ອນຈະຍ້າຍໄປດິດຖັດໄປ (ຫຼື ເອີ້ນວ່"
"າ chunk size). ຄ່າທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ແມ່ນຕົວເລກທີ່ໃຫຍ່ກວ່າ 0 ຫຼື 'none'."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:139
msgid "Enable Regular &Checks"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບແບບປົກກະຕິ"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:146
msgid ""
"Enable regular file system checks at booting. This option forces a file "
"system check after 30 system starts or 180 days, whichever comes first."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບປົກກະຕິໃນເວລາບູດ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ກວດສອບລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຫຼັງຈາກເປີດເຄື່"
"ອງ 30 ຄັ້ງ ຫຼື 180 ວັນ, ອັນໃດມາຮອດກ່ອນ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:156
msgid "&Directory Index Feature"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດດັດສະນີໄດເຣັກທໍຣີ"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:160
msgid "Enables use of hashed b-trees to speed up lookups in large directories."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໃຊ້ການນຳໃຊ້ hashed b-trees ເພື່ອເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໃນການຊອກຫາຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:168
msgid "&Use Journal"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ Journal"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:172
msgid ""
"Use journaling on filesystem (strongly advised). Only deactivate this when "
"you really know what you are doing."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ journaling ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ (ແນະນຳຢ່າງຍິ່ງ). ໃຫ້ປິດການໃຊ້ງານນີ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຈົ້າຮູ້ແທ້ໆວ່າກຳລັງເຮັດຫຍັງຢູ່."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:188
msgid "Block size bigger than page size."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດບລັອກໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຂະໜາດໜ້າ (page size)."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:193
msgid ""
"Specify the block size in bytes. If 'auto' is selected, the standard block "
"size of 4096 is used. The block size must not exceed the system pagesize."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຂະໜາດບລັອກເປັນໄບຕ໌. ຫາກເລືອກ 'auto', ຈະໃຊ້ຂະໜາດບລັອກມາດຕະຖານ 4096. ຂະໜາດບລັອກຕ້ອງບໍ່"
"ເກີນຂະໜາດໜ້າ (pagesize) ຂອງລະບົບ."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:209
msgid ""
"Specify the inode size in bytes. If 'auto' is selected, the inode size will "
"typically be 512. The inode size must not exceed one half of the block size."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຂະໜາດ Inode ເປັນໄບຕ໌. ຫາກເລືອກ 'auto', ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປຂະໜາດ Inode ຈະແມ່ນ 512. ຂະໜາດ "
"Inode ຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນເຄິ່ງໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະໜາດບລັອກ."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:219
msgid "&Percentage of Inode Space"
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນຂອງພື້ນທີ່ Inode"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:225
msgid "Choose a value between 0 and 100, or 'auto'."
msgstr "ເລືອກຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 100, ຫຼື 'auto'."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:229
msgid ""
"This option specifies the maximum percentage of space in the file system "
"that can be allocated to inodes. Choose a value between 0 and 100, or "
"'auto'. A value of 0 means that there are no restrictions on inode space."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ລະບຸເປີເຊັນສູງສຸດຂອງພື້ນທີ່ໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ສາມາດຈັດສັນໃຫ້ Inodes ໄດ້. ເລືອກຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ "
"100, ຫຼື 'auto'. ຄ່າ 0 ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າບໍ່ມີການຈຳກັດພື້ນທີ່ Inode."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:240
msgid "Inodes &Aligned"
msgstr "Inodes ທີ່ຈັດລຽງແລ້ວ"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:244
msgid ""
"This option is used to specify whether inode allocation is aligned. By "
"default inodes are aligned as this is more efficient than unaligned access. "
"But this option can be used to turn off inode alignment when the filesystem "
"needs to be mountable by an old version of IRIX that does not have the inode "
"alignment feature."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸວ່າການຈັດສັນ Inode ຈະຖືກຈັດລຽງ (align) ຫຼື ບໍ່. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ Inodes ຈະຖືກ"
"ຈັດລຽງໄວ້ຍ້ອນວ່າມັນມີປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍກວ່າ. ແຕ່ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປິດການຈັດລຽງ Inode ໄດ້ ເມື່ອຕ້ອງກ"
"ານໃຫ້ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ສາມາດຖືກ mount ໂດຍ IRIX ເວີຊັນເກົ່າທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄຸນສົມບັດການຈັດລຽງ Inode."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:256
msgid "FAT &Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ FAT"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:261
msgid ""
"Specify the size of the file allocation tables entries (12, 16, or 32 bit). "
"If 'auto' is specified, a suitable value is chosen dependng on the file "
"system size. Note that choosing an unsuitable FAT size might result in an "
"error when creating the file system."
msgstr ""
"ລະບຸຂະໜາດຂອງລາຍການໃນຕາຕະລາງການຈັດສັນໄຟລ໌ (12, 16, ຫຼື 32 ບິດ). ຫາກລະບຸ 'auto', ຈະເລືອກ"
"ຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມໂດຍອີງຕາມຂະໜາດຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌. ໝາຍເຫດ: ການເລືອກຂະໜາດ FAT ທີ່ບໍ່ເໝາະສົມອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ເກີ"
"ດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນເວລາສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:272
msgid "Number of &FATs"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ FATs"

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:277
msgid "Specify the number of file allocation tables. The default is 2."
msgstr "ລະບຸຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງການຈັດສັນໄຟລ໌. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 2."

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:286
msgid "Root &Dir Entries"
msgstr "ລາຍການໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຮາກ (Root)"

#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:292
msgid "The minimum number of entries is 16."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການຂັ້ນຕ່ຳແມ່ນ 16."

#. help text, richtext format
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/mkfs_optiondata.rb:296
msgid ""
"Select the number of entries available in the root directory. Choose a value "
"that is at least 16, or 'auto'. Note that the value is a lower limit and the "
"actual root directory may be larger."
msgstr ""
"ເລືອກຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຮາກ. ເລືອກຄ່າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 16, ຫຼື 'auto'. ໝາຍເຫດ: ຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນຂີດຈຳ"
"ກັດຂັ້ນຕ່ຳ ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີຮາກຕົວຈິງອາດຈະໃຫຍ່ກວ່ານີ້."

#. TRANSLATORS: button label
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/nfs_buttons.rb:36
msgid "Add NFS..."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ NFS..."

#. TRANSLATORS: html text of the Partitioner Help. Please make sure the menu
#. names actually match the ones in the menubar widget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/overview.rb:153
msgid ""
"<p>Below the menu bar, the main element of the interface is the table\n"
"that represents the available devices, with some buttons to provide quick\n"
"access to the most common actions. Additionally, the <b>Add</b> and \n"
"<b>Device</b> menus can be used to perform any action on the device\n"
"selected in the table.</p>\n"
"<p>The left tree can be used to navigate through the list of devices,\n"
"focusing on a particular device or type of devices.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ຖັດລົງມາຈາກແຖບເມນູ, ອົງປະກອບຫຼັກແມ່ນຕາຕະລາງ\n"
"ທີ່ສະແດງອຸປະກອນທີ່ມີຢູ່, ພ້ອມກັບປຸ່ມຕ່າງໆເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ\n"
"ການດຳເນີນການທົ່ວໄປໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເມນູ <b>ເພີ່ມ</b> ແລະ \n"
"<b>ອຸປະກອນ</b> ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອດຳເນີນການໃດໆກັບອຸປະກອນ\n"
"ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ໃນຕາຕະລາງໄດ້.</p>\n"
"<p>ໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ທາງເບື້ອງຊ້າຍສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເລືອກເບິ່ງລາຍການອຸປະກອນ,\n"
"ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ອຸປະກອນໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ປະເພດຂອງອຸປະກອນສະເພາະ.</p>"

#. TRANSLATORS: title of the Partitioner tab that summarizes the information of a device
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/overview_tab.rb:51
msgid "Device &Overview"
msgstr "ພາບລວມອຸປະກອນ"

#. Label for all the instances
#.
#. @see #label
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/pages/bcaches.rb:43
msgid "Bcache Devices"
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນ Bcache"

#. Label for all the instances
#.
#. @see #label
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/pages/btrfs_filesystems.rb:41
msgid "Btrfs"
msgstr "Btrfs"

#. @macro seeAbstractWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/pages/disks.rb:42
msgid "Hard Disks"
msgstr "ຮາດດິດ"

#. Label for all the instances
#.
#. @see #label
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/pages/lvm.rb:39
msgid "LVM Volume Groups"
msgstr "ກຸ່ມວໍລຸ່ມ LVM"

#. @see UsedDevicesTab#label
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/pages/lvm_vg.rb:100
msgid "&Physical Volumes"
msgstr "ວໍລຸ່ມຟີຊິກອນ"

#. Label for all the instances
#.
#. @see #label
