#. @see ConfigurableBlkDevicesTable#help
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/tmpfs_filesystems_table.rb:43
msgid ""
"<p>Only temporary file systems included in /etc/fstab are considered here. "
"Other automatically mounted temporary file systems are not shown.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ສະເພາະລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ລວມຢູ່ໃນ /etc/fstab ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກພິຈາລະນາຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວອື່"
"ນໆທີ່ຖືກ mount ແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດຈະບໍ່ຖືກສະແດງ.</p>"

#. @macro seeAbstractWidget
#: src/lib/y2partitioner/widgets/tmpfs_options.rb:64
msgid ""
"<p>The tmpfs facility allows the creation of very fast file systems whose "
"contents reside in virtual memory. The file system is automatically created "
"in the moment of mounting it and the contents are lost when the file system "
"is unmounted.</p><p>Although the file system consumes only as much memory as "
"required by its current contents, its max size is limited automatically by "
"the system based on the total amount of RAM. That max limit can be "
"customized with the appropriate fstab option.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Tmpfs ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໄວຫຼາຍ ເຊິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນ virtual memory. ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກສ້າງ"
"ຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນເວລາ mount ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະເສຍໄປເມື່ອ unmount.</p><p>ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຈະໃ"
"ຊ້ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳເທົ່າທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕາມຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີ, ແຕ່ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງມັນຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວ"
"ນ RAM ທັງໝົດ. ຂີດຈຳກັດສູງສຸດນັ້ນສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ fstab ທີ່ເໝາະສົມ.</p>"

