"Please, make sure you are entering the correct password."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ໄດ້ (ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຄັ້ງທີ %{attempt}):\n"
"\n"
"%{info}\n"
"\n"
"ກະລຸນາກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເຈົ້າປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. Human-readable description to use if the LVM tools report that the same PV is found more than
#. once.
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/activate.rb:159
msgid "The same LVM physical volume was found in several devices.\n"
msgstr "ພົບວໍລຸ່ມຟີຊິກອນ LVM ອັນດຽວກັນໃນຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນ.\n"

#. The user already tried LIBSTORAGE_MULTIPATH_AUTOSTART (and is not
#. using AutoYaST), there is nothing else we can advise.
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/activate.rb:164
msgid ""
"Maybe there are multipath devices in the system but multipath support was "
"not enabled.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"ອາດຈະມີອຸປະກອນ multipath ໃນລະບົບ ແຕ່ການຮອງຮັບ multipath ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້.\n"
"\n"

#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/activate.rb:170
msgid "Use 'start_multipath' in the AutoYaST profile to enable multipath."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ 'start_multipath' ໃນໂປຣໄຟລ໌ AutoYaST ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ multipath."

#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/activate.rb:174
msgid ""
"If YaST didn't offer the opportunity to enable multipath in a previous step, "
"try the 'LIBSTORAGE_MULTIPATH_AUTOSTART=ON' boot parameter.\n"
"More information at https://en.opensuse.org/SDB:Linuxrc"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກ YaST ບໍ່ໄດ້ສະເໜີໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ multipath ໃນຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້, ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ພາລາມິເຕີການບູດ "
"'LIBSTORAGE_MULTIPATH_AUTOSTART=ON'.\n"
"ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ https://en.opensuse.org/SDB:Linuxrc"

#. Callback to ask the user whether to retry or abort when the storage lock
#. cannot be acquired.
#.
#. @return [Boolean] true if the user decides to retry.
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/initialize.rb:51
msgid "Accessing the Storage Subsystem Failed"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງລະບົບຍ່ອຍການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

#. TRANSLATORS: %{name} is replaced by the name of a process (e.g., yast2)
#. and %{pid} by the pid of a process (e.g., 5032).
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/initialize.rb:93
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"The storage subsystem is locked by the application \"%{name}\" (%{pid}).\n"
"You must quit that application before you can continue.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to abort or try again?"
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບຍ່ອຍການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກລັອກໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ \"%{name}\" (%{pid}).\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປິດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນັ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍົກເລີກ ຫຼື ລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ?"

#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/initialize.rb:100
msgid ""
"The storage subsystem is locked by an unknown application.\n"
"You must quit that application before you can continue.\n"
"\n"
"Would you like to abort or try again?"
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບຍ່ອຍການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຖືກລັອກໂດຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ.\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງປິດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນນັ້ນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໄດ້.\n"
"\n"
"ເຈົ້າຕ້ອງການຍົກເລີກ ຫຼື ລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ?"

#. Reports activation and probing issues through IssuesReporter
#.
#. @param issues [IssuesList] Probing issues
#. @return [Boolean] true if the user accepts to continue; false otherwise
#. @see UserProbe#report_issues
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/yast_probe.rb:50
msgid "Issues found while analyzing the storage devices."
msgstr "ພົບບັນຫາໃນຂະນະທີ່ກວດສອບອຸປະກອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ."

#. Interactive pop-up, AutoYaST is not taken into account because this is
#. only used in normal mode, not in (auto)installation.
#.
#. @param packages [Array<String>] List of packages to install
#. @return [Boolean] true if the user accepts to install the packages; false otherwise
#. @see UserProbe#install_packages?
#: src/lib/y2storage/callbacks/yast_probe.rb:60
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The following package needs to be installed to fully analyze the system:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"If you ignore this and continue without installing it, the system\n"
"information presented by YaST will be incomplete."
msgid_plural ""
"The following packages need to be installed to fully analyze the system:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"If you ignore this and continue without installing them, the system\n"
"information presented by YaST will be incomplete."
msgstr[0] ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອວິເຄາະລະບົບໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເມີນເສີຍ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງມັນ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ\n"
"ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ YaST ຈະບໍ່ສົມບູນ."
msgstr[1] ""
"ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ເພື່ອວິເຄາະລະບົບໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນ:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"ຫາກເຈົ້າເມີນເສີຍ ແລະ ດຳເນີນການຕໍ່ໂດຍບໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງພວກມັນ, ຂໍ້ມູນລະບົບ\n"
"ທີ່ສະແດງໂດຍ YaST ຈະບໍ່ສົມບູນ."

