msgstr "ລຶບອອກເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ"

#. @see Widgets::Base
#: src/lib/y2storage/dialogs/guided_setup/widgets/other_partition_actions.rb:54
msgid "Choose what to do with other partitions"
msgstr "ເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບພາທິຊັນອື່ນໆ"

#. @return [Boolean]
#: src/lib/y2storage/dialogs/guided_setup/widgets/partition_actions.rb:97
msgid ""
"<p>You can choose what to do with existing partitions:</p><p><ul><li>Do not "
"modify (keep them as they are)</li><li>Remove if needed</li><li>Remove even "
"if not needed (always remove)</li></ul></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເຈົ້າສາມາດເລືອກສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດກັບພາທິຊັນທີ່ມີຢູ່:</p><p><ul><li>ບໍ່ຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂ (ເກັບໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ)</li>"
"<li>ລຶບອອກຫາກຈຳເປັນ</li><li>ລຶບອອກເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ (ລຶບສະເໝີ)</li></ul></p>"

#: src/lib/y2storage/dialogs/guided_setup/widgets/partition_actions.rb:110
msgid ""
"<p>And for Windows partitions, the following options are also available:"
"<ul><li>Resize if needed (Windows partitions only)</li><li>Resize or remove "
"if needed (Windows partitions only)</li></ul><p><p>That last option means to "
"try to resize the Windows partition(s) to make enough disk space available "
"for Linux, but if that is not enough, completely delete the Windows "
"partition.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ແລະ ສຳລັບພາທິຊັນ Windows, ຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:<ul><li>ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດຫາກຈຳເປັນ (ສະເພາະພາທິຊັ"
"ນ Windows)</li><li>ປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ຫຼື ລຶບອອກຫາກຈຳເປັນ (ສະເພາະພາທິຊັນ Windows)</li></ul>"
"<p><p>ຕົວເລືອກສຸດທ້າຍໝາຍເຖິງການລອງປ່ຽນຂະໜາດພາທິຊັນ Windows ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີພື້ນທີ່ພຽງພໍສຳລັບ Linux, ແ"
"ຕ່ຫາກຍັງບໍ່ພໍ, ຈະລຶບພາທິຊັນ Windows ອອກທັງໝົດ.</p>"

#. @see Widgets::Base
#: src/lib/y2storage/dialogs/guided_setup/widgets/root_disk_selector.rb:48
msgid "Please select a disk to use as the \"root\" partition (/)"
msgstr "ກະລຸນາເລືອກດິດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເປັນພາທິຊັນ \"ຮາກ\" (root) (/)"

#. @see Widgets::Base
#: src/lib/y2storage/dialogs/guided_setup/widgets/root_disk_selector.rb:103
msgid ""
"<p>Select the disk where to create the root filesystem. </p><p>This is also "
"the disk where boot-related partitions will typically be created as "
"necessary: /boot, ESP (EFI System Partition), BIOS-Grub. That means that "
"this disk should be usable by the machine's BIOS / firmware.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>ເລືອກດິດທີ່ຈະສ້າງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຮາກ. </p><p>ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວດິດນີ້ຈະເປັນບ່ອນສ້າງພາທິຊັນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບການບູ"
"ດຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ: /boot, ESP (EFI System Partition), BIOS-Grub. ນັ້ນໝາຍຄວາມວ່າດິດນີ້ຄວ"
"ນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໂດຍ BIOS / ເຟີມແວຂອງເຄື່ອງ.</p>"

