"ຫາກເຈົ້າດຳເນີນການຕໍ່, ກຸ່ມວໍລຸ່ມຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໃນພາຍຫຼັງເຊິ່ງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຂະບວນການຕິດຕັ້ງ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ກຸ່"
"ມວໍລຸ່ມທີ່ບໍ່ສົມບູນຈະຖືກເມີນເສີຍໂດຍຄຳແນະນຳການແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງມືແບ່ງພາທິຊັນແບບຊ່ຽວຊ"
"ານ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/missing_lvm_pv_issue.rb:61
msgid ""
"Incomplete volume groups are not visible in the Partitioner and will be "
"deleted at the final step, when all the changes are performed in the system."
msgstr ""
"ກຸ່ມວໍລຸ່ມທີ່ບໍ່ສົມບູນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນເຄື່ອງມືແບ່ງພາທິຊັນ ແລະ ຈະຖືກລຶບອອກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນສຸດທ້າຍ ເມື່ອການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົ"
"ດຖືກດຳເນີນການໃນລະບົບ."

#. This message is not very informative, but the Package module does
#. not provide any more information.
#.
#. TRANSLATORS: error popup
#: src/lib/y2storage/package_handler.rb:173
msgid "Installing required packages failed."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດທີ່ຈຳເປັນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#. TRANSLATORS: error popup. %s is the list of affected packages.
#: src/lib/y2storage/package_handler.rb:181
#, c-format
msgid "Adding the following packages failed: %s"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມແພັກເກດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ: %s"

#. Instance of the function to be always returned by the class
#. TRANSLATORS: name of a key derivation function used by LUKS
#: src/lib/y2storage/pbkd_function.rb:41
msgid "Argon2id"
msgstr "Argon2id"

#. Instance of the function to be always returned by the class
#. TRANSLATORS: name of a key derivation function used by LUKS
#: src/lib/y2storage/pbkd_function.rb:44
msgid "Argon2i"
msgstr "Argon2i"

#. Instance of the function to be always returned by the class
#. TRANSLATORS: name of a key derivation function used by LUKS
#: src/lib/y2storage/pbkd_function.rb:47
msgid "PBKDF2"
msgstr "PBKDF2"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a mount point like "/home"
#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:98
#, c-format
msgid "do not propose a separate %s"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງແນະນຳໃຫ້ແຍກ %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a mount point like "/home"
#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:101
#, c-format
msgid "disable snapshots and RAM-based size adjustments for %s"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ snapshot ແລະ ການປັບຂະໜາດຕາມ RAM ສຳລັບ %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a mount point like "/home"
#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:104
#, c-format
msgid "do not enable snapshots for %s"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເປີດໃຊ້ snapshot ສຳລັບ %s"

#. TRANSLATORS: %s is a mount point like "/home"
#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:107
#, c-format
msgid "do not adjust size of %s based on RAM size"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງປັບຂະໜາດຂອງ %s ຕາມຂະໜາດ RAM"

#. @see #volume_description
#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:116
msgid "do not propose swap"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງແນະນຳ swap"

#: src/lib/y2storage/proposal/settings_adjustment.rb:118
msgid "do not enlarge swap to RAM size"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງຂະຫຍາຍ swap ໃຫ້ເທົ່າກັບຂະໜາດ RAM"

#. rubocop:disable Layout/LineLength
#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:41
msgid "Resizing is not supported by this device."
msgstr "ອຸປະກອນນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:42
msgid "Combined limitations of partition and filesystem prevent resizing."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຮ່ວມກັນຂອງພາທິຊັນ ແລະ ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໄດ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:43
msgid "This filesystem does not support shrinking."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຫຍໍ້ຂະໜາດ (shrinking)."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:44
msgid "This multi-device filesystem does not support shrinking."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ແບບຫຼາຍອຸປະກອນນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຫຍໍ້ຂະໜາດ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:45
msgid "This filesystem does not support growing."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດ (growing)."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:46
msgid "Filesystem consistency check failed."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:47
msgid "This filesystem already has the minimum possible size."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:48
msgid "This filesystem already has the maximum possible size."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ນີ້ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:49
msgid "The filesystem is full."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ເຕັມແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:50
msgid "There is no space behind this partition."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງຖັດຈາກພາທິຊັນນີ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:51
msgid "This partition already has the minimum possible size."
msgstr "ພາທິຊັນນີ້ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:52
msgid "Extended partitions cannot be resized."
msgstr "ພາທິຊັນສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ (Extended) ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໄດ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:53
msgid "The partition on an implicit partition table cannot be resized."
msgstr "ພາທິຊັນໃນຕາຕະລາງພາທິຊັນແບບ implicit ບໍ່ສາມາດປ່ຽນຂະໜາດໄດ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:54
msgid "Shrinking of this type of LVM logical volumes is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການຫຍໍ້ວໍລຸ່ມລໍຈິກອນ LVM ປະເພດນີ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:55
msgid "Resizing of this type of LVM logical volumes is not supported."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດວໍລຸ່ມລໍຈິກອນ LVM ປະເພດນີ້."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:56
msgid "Resizing not supported since the logical volume has snapshots."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການປ່ຽນຂະໜາດ ເພາະວໍລຸ່ມລໍຈິກອນມີ snapshot ຢູ່."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:57
msgid "No space left in the LVM volume group."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີພື້ນທີ່ເຫຼືອໃນກຸ່ມວໍລຸ່ມ LVM."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:58
msgid "The LVM logical volume already has the minimum possible size."
msgstr "ວໍລຸ່ມລໍຈິກອນ LVM ມີຂະໜາດນ້ອຍສຸດເທົ່າທີ່ຈະເປັນໄປໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:59
msgid "The LVM thin logical volume already has the maximum size."
msgstr "ວໍລຸ່ມລໍຈິກອນ LVM thin ມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ສຸດແລ້ວ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:60
msgid "The encryption password is required."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ລະຫັດຜ່ານການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:61
msgid "Filesystem mounted in read-only mode."
msgstr "ລະບົບໄຟລ໌ຖືກ mount ໃນຮູບແບບອ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງດຽວ (read-only)."

#. One reason blocking a resize in (translated) text form.
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2storage/resize_info.rb:111
msgid "Unknown reason"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮູ້ສາເຫດ"

#. All encryption warnings detected in the setup
#.
#. Argion2* needs at least 4GiB of memory. Otherwise cryptsetup could crash (bsc#1246876).
#.
#. @return [Array<SetupError>]
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_checker.rb:101
#, c-format
msgid "Using %s for %s but this needs 4 GiB RAM at least."
msgstr "ກຳລັງໃຊ້ %s ສຳລັບ %s ແຕ່ສິ່ງນີ້ຕ້ອງການ RAM ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 4 GiB."

#. HTML representation for encryption warnings
#.
#. @return [String, nil] nil if there is no encryption warning
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:77
msgid "There could be problems while encrypting devices:\n"
msgstr "ອາດຈະເກີດບັນຫາໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດອຸປະກອນ:\n"

#. HTML representation for boot warnings
#.
#. @return [String, nil] nil if there is no boot warning
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:87
msgid "The system might not be able to boot:\n"
msgstr "ລະບົບອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດບູດໄດ້:\n"

#. HTML representation for mandatory product warnings
#.
#. @return [String, nil] nil if there is no product warning
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:97
msgid ""
"The system could not work properly because the following product "
"requirements were not fulfilled:\n"
msgstr ""
"ລະບົບອາດຈະເຮັດວຽກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ເພາະຄວາມຕ້ອງການຜະລິດຕະພັນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ:\n"

#. HTML representation for warnings about the mount points
#.
#. @return [String, nil] nil if there is no mount warning
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:110
msgid "The system could fail to initialize some mount point during boot:\n"
msgstr "ລະບົບອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນບາງຈຸດ mount ໃນເວລາບູດ:\n"

#. HTML representation for warnings from the enabled security policy
#.
#. @return [String, nil] nil if warnings cannot be represented, see {#with_security_policies}
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:129
#, c-format
msgid "The system does not comply with the %s security policy:"
msgstr "ລະບົບບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມນະໂຍບາຍຄວາມປອດໄພ %s:"

#. TRANSLATORS
#: src/lib/y2storage/setup_errors_presenter.rb:143
msgid ""
"The system cannot be installed because the following errors were found:\n"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຕິດຕັ້ງລະບົບໄດ້ ເພາະພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຕໍ່ໄປນີ້:\n"

#. Builds message of the issue
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2storage/unsupported_bcache_issue.rb:38
msgid "Bcache detected, but bcache is not supported on this platform."
msgstr "ກວດພົບ Bcache, ແຕ່ Bcache ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບໃນແພລດຟອມນີ້."

#. Builds description of the issue
#.
#. @return [String]
#: src/lib/y2storage/unsupported_bcache_issue.rb:45
msgid ""
"This may or may not work. Use at your own risk. The safe way is to remove "
"this bcache manually with command line tools and then restart YaST."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດຈະໄດ້ຜົນ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ຜົນ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຄວາມສ່ຽງຂອງເຈົ້າເອງ. ວິທີທີ່ປອດໄພແມ່ນການລຶບ bcache ນີ້ອອກເອ"
"ງດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງມື command line ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງເລີ່ມ YaST ໃໝ່."

